	 "\n<f1>Max # of Players: <f0> 26" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Listen up soldiers! You are faced with storming the enemy base in dense fog! Visibility is low so pay attention to your superiors because we won't hesitate to give you the status of MIA if you get lost!\n\nFailure is not an option.\n\nDISMISSED!\n\n<f1>Tips:\n<f0>Bases are similiar to those in the classic Snowblind.\nLayout is close to Obfuscation.\n\n<f1>Thanks to:\n<f0>Shadow of Death and Tedaw for debuting my maps on their server!\nOmnipotent & others for their mapping tutorials.\nThe mapping community at large for inspiration, demonstration, and perspiration.\nCAPKIRK for his kind words and his desire to have Hamster map for him = )\nAnd of course the team at Dynamix for Tribes!";
